            "review_title": "Review at Nha hang Nha Trang Com",
            "review_text": "Rogelio\nBig Spring, Texas2 contributions\n0\ngoof foof\nOct 2019\n· Oh .. a lot to say. I think that this hotel is the best hotel i've ever been having in knowledge that i have traveled quite a lot ! an amazing host, very very nice and she was like our mother! she took care of us and made an amazing breakfast all bio and natural with a very authentic view. The rooms were very comfy and with a great view on the favela and rio. Very cute pool with a cute bar. Adriana was away for a training on design and I would like to tell her, you don't need anymore courses because your hotel is stunning! Thanks a lot for our host and for everything during our stay.\nnot to mention that everything is so close, the famous stairs, lapa, the amazing streets of santa teresa and some very nice bars.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 7, 2019",
